WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.971
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:24.241 --> 00:26.241
Thitinant Inganan!

3
00:26.242 --> 00:28.242
Stop making all that annoying noise!

4
00:28.361 --> 00:31.920
And another thing,could you dress more appropriately for the workplace?

5
00:32.278 --> 00:34.278
So you judge people by what they wear, Boss?

6
00:34.675 --> 00:36.675
I've never thought I'm above anyone.

7
00:36.676 --> 00:38.787
But I've never lowered my standards,either.

8
00:38.787 --> 00:39.621
Ow!

9
00:39.621 --> 00:40.787
Then how about a bet?

10
00:40.788 --> 00:41.954
One day,

11
00:41.954 --> 00:43.954
those high standards of yours

12
00:43.955 --> 00:47.012
will come down for this girl.

13
00:47.427 --> 00:49.427
You'll end up begging to get into bed with me.

14
01:12.577 --> 01:13.377
Never mind

15
01:15.744 --> 01:17.544
Give it to me. I’ve got it.

16
01:20.011 --> 01:20.811
Careful.

17
01:49.177 --> 01:51.344
Hey, Boss, you can drop me off here.

18
01:55.344 --> 01:56.604
You live here?

19
01:57.546 --> 02:01.441
Look kind of shady.

20
02:05.411 --> 02:06.408
You don't trust people here...

21
02:08.234 --> 02:10.242
Or you don't trust me?

22
02:11.911 --> 02:13.148
You.

23
02:15.150 --> 02:16.319
But...

24
02:17.909 --> 02:20.171
It really doesn't look like a nice place to live.

25
02:28.144 --> 02:31.077
I guess your idea of a decent place to live is different from mine, Boss.

26
02:33.411 --> 02:35.011
I can walk to my room myself.

27
02:35.477 --> 02:36.711
You can leave me here, Boss.

28
02:37.011 --> 02:37.811
Thank you.

29
02:40.011 --> 02:40.911
Don't act tough.

30
02:41.344 --> 02:42.677
I'll walk you to your room.

31
02:51.144 --> 02:52.344
Are you sure about that, Boss?

32
02:53.744 --> 02:55.744
My room's on the third floor.

33
02:56.777 --> 02:57.877
And there's no elevator.

34
03:00.577 --> 03:02.711
How are you supposed to get there alone in your condition?

35
03:03.544 --> 03:05.277
Are you going to hold the handrail as you go up?

36
03:14.877 --> 03:15.677
Fine.

37
03:17.177 --> 03:19.744
But you have to hold on to me tight, okay?

38
03:22.544 --> 03:23.344
Okay.

39
03:33.144 --> 03:36.250
Hey, what perfume are you wearing?

40
03:37.428 --> 03:38.665
It smells nice.

41
03:41.197 --> 03:42.493
What perfume do I use, huh?

42
03:46.077 --> 03:47.377
I'm not wearing any perfume.

43
03:52.111 --> 03:53.344
You like this scent, Boss?

44
03:57.177 --> 03:58.144
It does smell nice.

45
03:58.944 --> 04:00.344
It smells clean, like baby powder.

46
04:01.744 --> 04:06.077
But I just fell into a pool of stagnant water.

47
04:08.077 --> 04:08.877
Ew!

48
04:09.311 --> 04:10.877
How do you like this scent, Boss?

49
04:17.611 --> 04:18.411
Ow!

50
04:18.877 --> 04:20.111
Just go.

51
04:32.944 --> 04:33.744
Hey!

52
04:34.477 --> 04:36.011
Why do you have to get your face so close to mine?

53
04:36.611 --> 04:37.411
You're annoying.

54
04:38.577 --> 04:40.944
So you can catch my scent clearly, Boss.

55
04:44.677 --> 04:46.295
Move your head away.

56
04:46.707 --> 04:49.777
And hurry up and walk, keep walking. You're so heavy!

57
04:50.744 --> 04:52.012
Stop yapping.

58
04:52.895 --> 04:55.811
You're the one who said you'd take responsibility for my life.

59
04:59.257 --> 05:00.544
yeah, yeah.

60
05:00.544 --> 05:02.507
Hurry... Just keep moving.

61
06:50.144 --> 06:51.218
Your room...

62
06:51.630 --> 06:53.311
It's actually nicer than I expected.

63
06:55.011 --> 06:58.577
Why? Did you think I'd be sleeping in a pile of garbage, Boss?

64
06:59.711 --> 07:01.544
Uh... Nothing.

65
07:08.077 --> 07:08.877
What?

66
07:08.977 --> 07:09.777
Nothing.

67
07:11.277 --> 07:12.311
Want me to take your jacket off for you?

68
07:14.977 --> 07:15.777
Come here.

69
07:40.177 --> 07:40.977
Come here.

70
07:41.144 --> 07:42.144
I'll take your shoes off for you.

71
07:44.744 --> 07:45.611
You're so sweet.

72
07:51.344 --> 07:52.877
I'll do it myself.

73
07:58.211 --> 08:01.077
Oh, you can do it yourself after all.

74
08:05.911 --> 08:08.377
Are you always this nice to everyone, Boss?

75
08:10.977 --> 08:12.542
I'm never nice to anyone.

76
08:13.131 --> 08:15.820
And I'm especially mean to people who treat me badly.

77
08:15.820 --> 08:18.219
Including you.

78
08:19.711 --> 08:21.144
And this is you being mean?

79
08:23.011 --> 08:25.311
I wonder how nice you'd be if you were being nice.

80
08:27.041 --> 08:30.313
That person is going to be so lucky.

81
08:34.711 --> 08:35.511
Uh...

82
08:36.144 --> 08:38.931
Well, if that's everything, I'll...

83
08:39.343 --> 08:40.215
get going.

84
08:41.077 --> 08:41.877
Ow!

85
08:42.677 --> 08:43.477
Ow!

86
08:45.344 --> 08:46.144
It's hurt.

87
08:46.677 --> 08:49.013
Ow, it hurts. It hurts.

88
08:49.411 --> 08:50.211
Let me see.

89
08:51.144 --> 08:52.077
Where else does it hurt?

90
08:52.711 --> 08:55.319
Right here.

91
09:02.477 --> 09:03.277
Why are you smiling?

92
09:05.311 --> 09:06.111
What?

93
09:06.977 --> 09:08.211
I'm not smiling.

94
09:09.611 --> 09:10.411
It hurts.

95
09:11.177 --> 09:12.944
So I'm just gritting my teeth.

96
09:17.077 --> 09:18.411
Stop being so dramatic.

97
09:21.511 --> 09:22.311
Ow.

98
09:24.477 --> 09:26.177
Ow, that hurts.

99
09:30.544 --> 09:31.377
What are you doing?

100
09:33.511 --> 09:36.288
Nothing. I was just sneaking a peek.

101
09:36.641 --> 09:38.930
To see if you secretly disgust me?

102
09:41.477 --> 09:44.511
If I did, would I have gone this far for you?

103
09:54.477 --> 09:55.529
Do you have any ice?

104
09:56.883 --> 09:59.611
I'll ice it for you so you'll finally stop complaining.

105
10:00.311 --> 10:02.977
I do, but it's okay. I can get it myself.

106
10:03.677 --> 10:05.818
Just sit still, will you?

107
10:06.583 --> 10:07.992
I'll get it.

108
10:08.522 --> 10:11.211
In your state, just sit down. It is over there, right?

109
10:12.211 --> 10:13.177
In the fridge.

110
10:14.911 --> 10:15.711
Okay.

111
10:29.344 --> 10:31.611
Ow! That's cold.

112
10:32.577 --> 10:36.111
Hang in there. It'll keep the swelling down.

113
10:48.277 --> 10:51.144
Do you live by yourself?

114
10:53.711 --> 10:57.344
Yes, My parents passed away when I was little.

115
11:01.111 --> 11:03.511
Uh, sorry for asking.

116
11:05.177 --> 11:06.011
It's okay.

117
11:09.711 --> 11:10.511
Eh?

118
11:10.811 --> 11:11.611
What?

119
11:12.677 --> 11:13.877
Why do you ask, Boss?

120
11:16.311 --> 11:19.277
Or are you starting to fall for me?

121
11:21.977 --> 11:23.511
I was just making polite conversation.

122
11:24.544 --> 11:25.344
Oh, really?

123
11:25.911 --> 11:26.711
Mm-hmm.

124
11:27.544 --> 11:28.977
You drove me home...

125
11:30.177 --> 11:31.111
Carried me up to my room...

126
11:32.744 --> 11:34.377
And even put ice on my injury.

127
11:35.211 --> 11:36.877
If you're not interested, then fine.

128
11:37.977 --> 11:39.211
I was just asking.

129
11:42.677 --> 11:44.377
But thank you, Boss.

130
11:47.777 --> 11:50.306
Uh, what I did...

131
11:51.130 --> 11:52.329
Was because I was the one who hurt you.

132
11:53.448 --> 11:54.771
Don't read too much into it.

133
11:59.277 --> 12:00.811
I'm not reading anything into it.

134
12:02.277 --> 12:03.744
You're awfully defensive, Boss.

135
12:06.944 --> 12:08.077
Or are you afraid...

136
12:09.311 --> 12:13.011
That I'll find out you've got a soft spot for me?

137
12:24.544 --> 12:25.911
Here. Ice it yourself.

138
12:27.144 --> 12:28.311
I'm going home.

139
12:30.577 --> 12:31.777
Wait, Boss.

140
12:33.177 --> 12:34.811
Can you stay with me for a while?

141
12:36.577 --> 12:37.377
Please?

142
12:38.077 --> 12:39.577
Stay with me a little longer.

143
12:42.580 --> 12:43.461
Please?

144
12:45.711 --> 12:46.511
Oh.

145
12:47.611 --> 12:48.411
The power's out.

146
13:03.077 --> 13:03.877
Is that normal?

147
13:07.477 --> 13:08.277
Hey.

148
13:09.677 --> 13:10.611
What are you looking for?

149
13:10.877 --> 13:11.911
A flashlight.

150
13:16.377 --> 13:18.677
Hey, wait! Where are you going?

151
13:19.677 --> 13:20.777
To get a candle.

152
13:21.144 --> 13:21.872
A candle?

153
13:22.166 --> 13:22.886
It's fine.

154
13:23.652 --> 13:25.544
I'll get it. You stay here.

155
13:26.611 --> 13:27.411
Where is it?

156
13:29.511 --> 13:33.111
Uh, there's a candle up there.

157
13:34.111 --> 13:36.377
Okay. Stay put.

158
14:17.877 --> 14:19.177
How romantic.

159
14:24.577 --> 14:26.077
There's nothing romantic about this.

160
14:27.944 --> 14:30.344
Doesn't this place have a backup generator?

161
14:31.344 --> 14:32.144
Ow!

162
14:32.211 --> 14:34.477
How could a cheap rental like this

163
14:35.011 --> 14:36.777
have a backup generator, Boss?

164
14:37.477 --> 14:39.511
It loses power as soon as it rains a little.

165
14:44.144 --> 14:47.577
But the power will be back soon. Just give it a minute.

166
14:52.911 --> 14:55.811
It's not like I plan to stay here with you until the power comes back.

167
14:56.777 --> 14:57.944
I've had a long day.

168
14:58.744 --> 14:59.544
I want to rest.

169
15:12.544 --> 15:14.111
Want to rest here, Boss?

170
15:16.177 --> 15:18.177
I'll be your pillow.

171
15:24.111 --> 15:24.795
No, thanks.

172
15:25.266 --> 15:26.569
You're practically bone-dry.

173
15:26.922 --> 15:29.162
Going back to sleep at my condo

174
15:29.162 --> 15:31.423
would be way more peaceful.

175
15:56.677 --> 15:59.144
Boss...

176
16:02.977 --> 16:04.452
So...

177
16:07.632 --> 16:09.334
Aren't you ever scared living in a place like this?

178
16:12.801 --> 16:13.682
Nope.

179
16:15.010 --> 16:16.303
What are you afraid of, Boss?

180
16:17.744 --> 16:18.760
Running out of money.

181
16:20.998 --> 16:22.277
I'm afraid of that too.

182
16:23.944 --> 16:24.744
Oh!

183
16:25.211 --> 16:26.911
But now I've got something else to be afraid of.

184
16:28.311 --> 16:29.111
I'm afraid...

185
16:29.744 --> 16:31.411
Of weirdos like you...

186
16:31.711 --> 16:32.511
Coming into my life.

187
16:33.011 --> 16:33.811
Too late.

188
16:34.977 --> 16:36.577
Because a weirdo like me...

189
16:37.811 --> 16:40.511
Has already wormed my way into your life.

190
16:44.144 --> 16:45.677
What are you, a parasite?

191
16:48.544 --> 16:49.411
That's harsh, isn't it?

192
16:53.277 --> 16:55.240
I could be even harsher.

193
16:56.064 --> 16:59.611
So you'd better be a good little servant and do as I say.

194
17:06.011 --> 17:07.744
When Boss drops the tough act...

195
17:09.511 --> 17:11.311
You're actually pretty cute.

196
17:17.211 --> 17:18.011
Watch it!

197
17:27.277 --> 17:28.077
Boss...

198
17:29.411 --> 17:30.211
Hmm?

199
17:30.811 --> 17:33.711
Stay with me until the power comes back.

200
17:37.080 --> 17:37.843
Please?

201
17:39.080 --> 17:39.961
Please?

202
17:39.961 --> 17:41.843
Keep me company, okay?

203
17:42.468 --> 17:43.317
Mmm...

204
17:44.377 --> 17:45.177
Fine.

205
17:59.612 --> 18:00.552
Boss...

206
18:00.552 --> 18:01.551
Hmm?

207
18:04.344 --> 18:06.577
Have you started falling for me yet?

208
18:17.544 --> 18:18.344
Not yet.

209
18:45.777 --> 18:47.577
Ow! Wh-What...?

210
18:48.777 --> 18:50.011
Why are you getting up, Boss?

211
18:52.744 --> 18:53.611
I'm fine.

212
18:54.711 --> 18:55.577
I'm going home.

213
18:56.711 --> 18:57.511
And...

214
18:57.677 --> 18:59.077
If you still can't walk tomorrow...

215
18:59.111 --> 19:00.911
Don't bother showing up at the office.

216
19:01.144 --> 19:01.944
I'm sick of it.

217
19:03.411 --> 19:04.877
Come pick me up tomorrow too, Boss.

218
19:05.311 --> 19:06.111
No.

219
19:06.577 --> 19:09.977
But you said you'd take responsibility for my life.

220
19:11.677 --> 19:13.311
You have to come pick me up tomorrow, Boss.

221
19:13.811 --> 19:15.677
Because if you don't come pick me up...

222
19:15.877 --> 19:17.344
I'll report you to the Department of Labour.

223
19:17.577 --> 19:19.277
For running over your own employee.

224
19:19.477 --> 19:20.277
How about that?

225
19:20.611 --> 19:21.411
Scared yet?

226
19:23.911 --> 19:25.011
You're such a little brat.

227
19:26.111 --> 19:27.077
Thitinant!

228
19:28.177 --> 19:29.711
Keep dreaming. I'm not coming!

229
19:36.321 --> 19:37.614
Bye-bye.

230
20:04.111 --> 20:04.911
Damn it!

231
20:06.477 --> 20:08.277
Why is my heart beating so fast?

232
20:23.344 --> 20:24.477
What's wrong with her?

233
20:25.477 --> 20:27.911
She was fine when the power went out.

234
20:48.677 --> 20:49.511
That crazy brat.

235
20:53.311 --> 20:54.811
What am I even doing here?

236
21:05.144 --> 21:07.544
Don't forget to delete Yong's video.

237
21:25.744 --> 21:27.229
You want me to delete it, Boss?

238
21:27.229 --> 21:28.674
In your dreams!

239
21:29.911 --> 21:34.277
I went to so much trouble to get that video.

240
21:36.377 --> 21:39.853
I've had enough, Ms. Chat!

241
21:41.090 --> 21:43.067
Please, just let me go.

242
21:44.304 --> 21:45.805
Please, just let me go.

243
21:46.777 --> 21:47.970
Oh, Yong!

244
21:48.618 --> 21:50.497
Make your face look sadder!

245
21:51.145 --> 21:52.454
Ms. Chat is smart, you know.

246
21:52.807 --> 21:55.377
If she finds out we're faking this...

247
21:55.777 --> 21:57.522
Ow, you idiot!

248
21:57.816 --> 21:59.611
This is pathetic enough already!

249
22:01.911 --> 22:03.544
I've bowed to the camera four times now!

250
22:03.677 --> 22:05.811
Keep bowing like this. Ugh, my back hurts!

251
22:06.311 --> 22:07.111
Hang in there.

252
22:07.611 --> 22:09.477
Because if she finds out we're faking it...

253
22:09.811 --> 22:12.811
We're both as good as dead.

254
22:13.711 --> 22:14.511
Rin.

255
22:14.811 --> 22:16.377
Add some blood to the corner of his mouth.

256
22:16.811 --> 22:17.611
Come here.

257
22:17.711 --> 22:18.777
Turn your face this way.

258
22:20.372 --> 22:21.489
Stay still.

259
22:24.944 --> 22:26.511
That's enough. Come sit here.

260
22:28.277 --> 22:29.077
Three.

261
22:29.111 --> 22:29.911
Two.

262
22:30.277 --> 22:31.077
One.

263
22:31.811 --> 22:34.620
I've had enough, Ms. Chat!

264
22:35.183 --> 22:36.334
I've had enough!

265
22:41.311 --> 22:42.575
If you want me to delete it...

266
22:44.401 --> 22:46.883
Come to my room and delete it yourself.

267
22:58.944 --> 22:59.944
This is Boss's jacket...

268
23:22.111 --> 23:23.811
I left my suit jacket at that brat's place.

269
23:49.612 --> 23:50.905
Boss, you left your jacket here.

270
23:50.905 --> 23:52.375
Your jacket smells so good.

271
23:52.375 --> 23:55.489
I'm borrowing it to sleep in tonight.

272
23:58.877 --> 24:01.677
How dare you call me baby?

273
24:12.253 --> 24:15.714
I'm wearing this to work tomorrow.

274
24:16.284 --> 24:17.073
Huh?

275
24:26.377 --> 24:27.177
Damn it!

276
24:27.877 --> 24:28.677
Theerachat.

277
24:29.177 --> 24:30.344
Get a hold of yourself.

278
25:04.877 --> 25:06.677
If Boss sees this whole set...

279
25:08.111 --> 25:08.911
She's definitely got flustered.

280
25:11.744 --> 25:12.944
See you tomorrow, Boss.

281
25:40.577 --> 25:42.211
She's really good at getting under my skin.

282
25:45.077 --> 25:46.011
Boss Chat.

283
25:46.744 --> 25:47.544
Yes?

284
25:47.677 --> 25:50.677
Ms. Sopha would like to discuss this year's budget ahead of schedule.

285
25:51.544 --> 25:52.344
Hmm.

286
25:52.611 --> 25:53.347
Sure.

287
25:53.347 --> 25:53.877
All right.

288
25:54.377 --> 25:57.411
I'll coordinate the details for you.

289
25:58.211 --> 25:59.017
That should be...

290
25:59.017 --> 25:59.777
Good Morning.

291
26:01.744 --> 26:02.544
Good Morning.

292
26:04.677 --> 26:05.477
Wait a minute.

293
26:05.944 --> 26:07.711
She's really wearing that to work?

294
26:10.211 --> 26:11.011
You've got to be kidding me.

295
26:15.077 --> 26:16.117
This is bad, Secretary Han.

296
26:16.117 --> 26:16.977
Yes?

297
26:17.144 --> 26:18.711
Go distract Ms. Sopha.

298
26:18.811 --> 26:20.711
Talk about stocks, the weather, anything!

299
26:21.077 --> 26:21.711
Go, now!

300
26:21.711 --> 26:22.111
Uh...

301
26:22.111 --> 26:22.646
Right now!

302
26:22.646 --> 26:23.336
Understood, Boss.

303
26:23.336 --> 26:23.836
Go, go!

304
26:24.177 --> 26:25.777
Ms. Sopha.

305
26:25.944 --> 26:26.277
Um...

306
26:26.277 --> 26:28.577
Regarding this year's annual budget...

307
26:28.944 --> 26:29.744
At this point...

308
26:29.877 --> 26:31.744
I think we may need to make some adjustments.

309
26:38.311 --> 26:39.711
Do you want to get fired?

310
26:44.977 --> 26:46.177
What the hell are you doing?

311
26:47.611 --> 26:49.777
I couldn't breathe, Boss.

312
26:53.711 --> 26:55.477
And why are you dressed like this at work?

313
26:57.977 --> 26:59.677
You gave me permission last night.

314
27:02.211 --> 27:03.020
Besides...

315
27:03.550 --> 27:05.878
If I wear your suit jacket like this...

316
27:06.290 --> 27:08.885
Everyone will know I'm already taken.

317
27:12.577 --> 27:15.277
That's ridiculous. Take it off. Now.

318
27:20.000 --> 27:22.360
So, you want me to take this off?

319
27:22.882 --> 27:23.913
Yeah.

320
27:24.524 --> 27:25.320
Okay.

321
27:32.411 --> 27:33.446
Stop!

322
27:34.859 --> 27:35.811
Don't take it off.

323
27:41.911 --> 27:43.597
First you tell me to take it off, then to put it on.

324
27:43.891 --> 27:45.077
What do you want?

325
27:48.177 --> 27:51.077
Leave it on. Wear it over your outfit like that.

326
27:52.611 --> 27:53.511
Why?

327
27:54.377 --> 27:56.577
Because what you're wearing underneath is...

328
28:02.577 --> 28:03.877
It's hideous.

329
28:04.544 --> 28:05.966
Absolutely hideous.

330
28:08.111 --> 28:08.911
Hideous?

331
28:09.377 --> 28:10.177
Yeah.

332
28:10.477 --> 28:11.777
And don't let me catch you...

333
28:11.977 --> 28:13.611
Taking off that jacket before the end of the workday.

334
28:14.311 --> 28:16.111
Or I'll deduct it from your salary.

335
28:32.577 --> 28:33.533
By the way...

336
28:34.770 --> 28:36.111
Does your ankle feel better now?

337
28:39.977 --> 28:40.877
It's much better.

338
28:42.577 --> 28:43.944
Thanks to you, Boss.

339
28:51.511 --> 28:53.511
Why do you always talk such nonsense?

340
28:58.911 --> 29:00.235
I'll head out first, then.

341
29:00.706 --> 29:02.436
Count to twenty in your head...

342
29:02.730 --> 29:04.346
Before you come out.

343
29:04.346 --> 29:05.415
Understand?

344
29:06.777 --> 29:07.577
Okay.

345
29:10.877 --> 29:11.677
Start counting.

346
29:13.144 --> 29:13.944
One.

347
29:15.111 --> 29:15.911
Two.

348
29:16.411 --> 29:17.777
I'm going to take it off now.

349
29:20.277 --> 29:21.144
Should I take it off, Boss?

350
29:21.144 --> 29:21.744
Stop!

351
29:22.711 --> 29:24.677
And don't take that suit jacket off before the end of the workday.

352
29:25.111 --> 29:25.911
Under any circumstances!

353
29:26.377 --> 29:27.177
Understand?

354
29:28.011 --> 29:28.811
Got it?

355
29:31.111 --> 29:31.911
Yes, Boss.

356
29:34.211 --> 29:35.011
Keep counting.

357
29:36.011 --> 29:36.977
What number was I on?

358
29:37.511 --> 29:38.311
Three.

359
29:38.811 --> 29:39.611
Four.

360
29:50.544 --> 29:51.344
So cute.

361
29:52.511 --> 29:53.611
Ms. Theerachat.

362
30:08.977 --> 30:09.944
Boss Chat.

363
30:10.144 --> 30:11.911
There's a problem with the warehouse system.

364
30:12.211 --> 30:13.311
The team there can't handle it.

365
30:13.711 --> 30:14.911
I'd like to go and check it out.

366
30:15.744 --> 30:16.544
Mm-hmm.

367
30:16.777 --> 30:17.577
Go ahead.

368
30:17.977 --> 30:19.411
I'll handle things here.

369
31:03.411 --> 31:05.977
I'll take the meeting minutes for you, Boss.

370
31:11.744 --> 31:13.875
As for my assistant's attire...

371
31:13.875 --> 31:15.151
I'll deal with that later.

372
31:17.448 --> 31:19.011
Let's get on with the meeting.

373
31:20.211 --> 31:22.188
I'm sure you can handle the dress code issue.

374
31:22.895 --> 31:24.978
But what concerns me more is...

375
31:25.214 --> 31:29.124
Why is there an intern in our boardroom?

376
31:33.177 --> 31:36.001
Secretary Han had something urgent to attend to.

377
31:36.649 --> 31:38.726
So she sent the intern in her place.

378
31:39.611 --> 31:43.458
May I ask, Ms. Sopha... Did you come here to meet with me...

379
31:44.400 --> 31:46.356
Or with my secretary?

380
31:48.544 --> 31:49.548
Let's get straight to the point.

381
31:50.726 --> 31:52.662
Since the wedding fell apart that day..

382
31:53.251 --> 31:57.528
Have you found a new logistics provider for the board to consider?

383
31:59.311 --> 32:00.654
I'm asking because

384
32:01.596 --> 32:03.200
I genuinely care about the company.

385
32:03.907 --> 32:08.200
Personal issues shouldn't affect the shareholders' interests.

386
32:08.671 --> 32:10.389
to be damaged as well.

387
32:17.277 --> 32:18.678
Excuse me.

388
32:19.915 --> 32:22.648
Last night, I compared the company's existing data.

389
32:22.942 --> 32:25.558
If we switch to alternative routes...

390
32:26.029 --> 32:29.909
We can still reduce costs by around 15%.

391
32:33.144 --> 32:35.877
The team is currently comparing service providers.

392
32:36.677 --> 32:38.077
Once we've reached a conclusion...

393
32:38.744 --> 32:40.577
I'll submit it to the board immediately.

394
32:41.811 --> 32:42.661
Good.

395
32:42.661 --> 32:46.494
At least you've come prepared for today's meeting.

396
32:46.847 --> 32:48.816
However, regarding the logistics company...

397
32:49.228 --> 32:51.818
I still stand by my original proposal.

398
32:51.818 --> 32:52.941
I hope...

399
32:53.707 --> 32:54.407
Ms. Chat...

400
32:55.114 --> 32:56.595
Will reconsider it...

401
32:57.302 --> 32:59.611
Before making another decision on your own.

402
33:00.477 --> 33:02.577
I never makes decisions entirely on my own.

403
33:03.311 --> 33:04.344
Every time, there's always...

404
33:04.711 --> 33:07.211
A risk assessment team and supporting data involved.

405
33:07.777 --> 33:09.511
I always puts the company's interests...

406
33:10.611 --> 33:13.744
Ahead of any personal gain.

407
33:14.744 --> 33:16.877
So, if no one has any further questions...

408
33:17.944 --> 33:19.977
Let's move on to the next agenda item.

409
33:21.911 --> 33:26.111
Next, let's discuss the banana project.

410
33:26.511 --> 33:29.911
I think our company should start producing bananas for export.

411
33:45.711 --> 33:47.277
If there are no further questions...

412
33:48.311 --> 33:51.011
I'll conclude today's meeting here.

413
33:52.411 --> 33:54.693
You're quite something, aren't you?

414
33:54.693 --> 33:56.634
Even though this girl was the one who ruined your wedding...

415
33:57.105 --> 33:59.032
You still hired her to work by your side.

416
33:59.268 --> 34:02.602
Especially since you're not usually the type to give people...

417
34:02.838 --> 34:05.525
Who damage your reputation a second chance.

418
34:09.811 --> 34:11.397
Well, let's just say...

419
34:12.104 --> 34:14.477
You've seen a new side of me today, Ms. Sopha.

420
34:17.744 --> 34:20.511
All right, this meeting is adjourned.

421
35:13.111 --> 35:14.399
Thitinant Inganan.

422
35:15.636 --> 35:18.011
Come to my office and help me right now.

423
35:20.611 --> 35:21.411
Please, go ahead.

424
35:28.911 --> 35:29.711
Have a seat.

425
35:46.477 --> 35:47.563
This is...

426
35:48.859 --> 35:50.111
The company's new project.

427
35:51.544 --> 35:53.011
Organic wine?

428
35:54.311 --> 35:55.157
That's right.

429
35:55.687 --> 35:59.506
Research the vineyard's history, grape varieties, and flavor profiles.

430
36:00.154 --> 36:02.562
Compile everything and submit it to me by the end of today.

431
36:03.916 --> 36:05.952
You can't leave until you're done.

432
36:09.411 --> 36:12.335
I've only ever served wine when I worked as a waitress.

433
36:13.811 --> 36:17.177
I had no idea there'd be this much information to go through.

434
36:20.344 --> 36:23.377
Since you can handle your liquor, I thought you were a master at this.

435
36:24.944 --> 36:26.011
Not at all, Boss.

436
36:26.911 --> 36:29.811
All I know is that you shouldn't drink red wine after white wine.

437
36:30.511 --> 36:31.477
Otherwise...

438
36:32.177 --> 36:34.177
They'll clash, and you'll get completely wasted.

439
36:36.277 --> 36:37.177
Keep that in mind.

440
36:38.211 --> 36:40.811
Don't just do whatever people dare you to do just for money.

441
36:43.311 --> 36:46.011
Honestly, I can drink pretty much anything.

442
36:47.911 --> 36:49.077
Except one thing.

443
36:50.777 --> 36:51.577
Soju.

444
36:52.144 --> 36:53.544
I really can't handle soju.

445
36:53.877 --> 36:54.911
After just two or three glasses...

446
36:55.111 --> 36:57.144
I actually passed out at the bar.

447
37:00.811 --> 37:02.277
You're so careless.

448
37:03.544 --> 37:06.177
You're telling your enemy your own weakness.

449
37:07.277 --> 37:08.077
Huh?

450
37:09.011 --> 37:10.744
But you're not my enemy, Boss.

451
37:16.011 --> 37:18.735
You're my darling.

452
37:23.206 --> 37:24.264
Anyway...

453
37:24.617 --> 37:25.969
When are you going to start working?

454
37:36.177 --> 37:40.144
Why is there so much work all of a sudden?

455
37:50.077 --> 37:53.211
Or is all this work just an excuse?

456
37:54.577 --> 37:56.977
You just want to be alone with me, don't you, Boss?

457
37:59.311 --> 38:00.877
Did I not give you enough work?

458
38:05.544 --> 38:06.344
No, you did.

459
38:07.344 --> 38:08.144
Plenty of work.

460
38:08.711 --> 38:10.011
Then I'll get to it.

461
38:46.311 --> 38:47.877
Why is your stomach growling so loudly?

462
38:50.877 --> 38:53.511
I haven't even had lunch yet.

463
38:55.077 --> 38:57.177
You dragged me in here to work out of nowhere.

464
39:00.277 --> 39:01.077
(Sigh.)

465
39:02.111 --> 39:03.144
I happen to be hungry too.

466
39:03.977 --> 39:05.677
Let's order something and eat together.

467
39:07.311 --> 39:08.511
Thank you, Boss.

468
39:28.477 --> 39:30.744
Boss, the food we ordered is here.

469
39:34.911 --> 39:36.744
I'll excuse myself and eat outside, then.

470
39:36.911 --> 39:38.077
You're eating here with me.

471
39:39.677 --> 39:43.877
As for Hanna, you're going out to inspect the factory today, right?

472
39:44.211 --> 39:45.011
Yes.

473
39:45.144 --> 39:48.977
When you finish, no need to return to the office. Just go home.

474
39:49.877 --> 39:50.711
Yes, Boss.

475
39:51.211 --> 39:52.011
Oh, right.

476
39:53.377 --> 39:56.811
There's a company dinner tonight, isn't there?

477
39:57.211 --> 40:00.411
Yes, it's a welcome dinner for the interns.

478
40:01.977 --> 40:04.965
But I suspect some people won't be able to make it...

479
40:06.084 --> 40:07.677
Because they definitely won't finish their work in time.

480
40:09.277 --> 40:13.277
Actually, tonight's dinner is to welcome the interns.

481
40:13.377 --> 40:14.811
If Nant can't come...

482
40:15.744 --> 40:16.544
I think...

483
40:17.077 --> 40:18.077
What can we do?

484
40:19.611 --> 40:20.944
Work comes first,

485
40:23.011 --> 40:23.811
right?

486
40:29.711 --> 40:31.277
Get back to your work.

487
40:32.277 --> 40:33.077
Yes, Boss.

488
40:47.344 --> 40:48.144
Here.

489
40:49.111 --> 40:49.977
What are you going to eat?

490
40:52.211 --> 40:53.111
Pad Krapao?

491
40:54.411 --> 40:55.211
Okay.

492
40:57.711 --> 41:00.744
Wait, I just said I wanted Pad Krapao?

493
41:01.944 --> 41:02.947
Did you say that?

494
41:04.596 --> 41:06.695
Well, I want Pad Krapao, too.

495
41:07.048 --> 41:08.630
Are you going to steal my food?

496
41:12.144 --> 41:12.944
No, Boss.

497
41:17.911 --> 41:19.744
Is it that important for you to win?

498
41:21.277 --> 41:23.377
Cut the nonsense. Are you eating this or not?

499
41:23.577 --> 41:24.112
Yes, I am.

500
41:24.112 --> 41:25.879
(Chat) If you won't, I'll take both. (Nan) I'll eat!

501
41:41.111 --> 41:42.811
Can I have a little of Pad Krapao?

502
42:07.277 --> 42:08.944
Here, let me help.

503
42:20.777 --> 42:21.577
Sorry.

504
42:23.277 --> 42:24.577
Do you have a cold, Boss?

505
42:25.311 --> 42:30.111
Uh, no. I think it's just allergies.

506
42:32.111 --> 42:34.777
Hmm, the air is weirdly dusty today.

507
42:35.277 --> 42:36.584
Huh?

508
42:38.174 --> 42:38.920
Or maybe...

509
42:39.803 --> 42:41.486
Last night...

510
42:42.193 --> 42:44.344
Did you sneak out and stand in the night dew somewhere, Boss?

511
42:45.577 --> 42:46.327
No.

512
42:47.328 --> 42:48.788
Focus on your work already.

513
43:18.611 --> 43:19.411
Boss...

514
43:20.777 --> 43:22.811
Please take your meds and stay masked up, Boss.

515
43:23.344 --> 43:25.411
PM 2.5 levels are really high lately.

516
43:26.111 --> 43:27.477
You might end up getting seriously sick.

517
43:28.811 --> 43:29.611
Uh...

518
43:33.711 --> 43:34.842
Thanks.

519
43:36.138 --> 43:37.530
But I'd rather not take the medicine yet.

520
43:38.060 --> 43:40.133
It'll make me sleepy, and I won't be able to work.

521
43:46.877 --> 43:48.311
Um, Boss...

522
43:48.611 --> 43:51.111
The Ruby Roman grapes you asked me to look into...

523
43:51.277 --> 43:52.377
They're back in stock at the usual shop.

524
43:52.744 --> 43:54.411
Would you like me to place an order?

525
43:55.744 --> 43:57.977
No need. I'll go check them out myself.

526
43:59.277 --> 44:00.077
Okay, Boss

527
44:00.611 --> 44:01.741
Oh, I see

528
44:01.741 --> 44:02.504
You, the intern.

529
44:03.211 --> 44:04.067
You're coming with me.

530
44:05.186 --> 44:06.654
Help me carry the gift basket.

531
44:09.311 --> 44:10.111
Huh?

532
44:10.944 --> 44:13.177
But I haven't finished the paperwork yet.

533
44:15.377 --> 44:17.344
You can finish it later.

534
44:18.277 --> 44:20.344
Huh? We're going now?

535
44:21.544 --> 44:22.877
Yeah. Let's go.

536
44:30.677 --> 44:34.911
Your boss really just goes wherever she wants, doesn't she?

537
44:35.411 --> 44:38.377
That's normal. You'll get used to it after a while.

538
44:39.577 --> 44:43.111
But you have to come to tonight's dinner, Nant.

539
44:45.344 --> 44:46.144
Ugh!

540
44:46.911 --> 44:48.411
I don't even know if I'll be able to make it

541
44:48.944 --> 44:51.211
Look at me. She dragged me off to work.

542
44:51.911 --> 44:53.277
Who knows when we'll be done?

543
44:56.511 --> 44:57.311
Intern!

544
44:57.744 --> 44:58.744
What are you waiting for?

545
44:59.477 --> 45:00.177
Yes.

546
45:00.177 --> 45:02.077
Yes, I'm coming.

547
45:15.077 --> 45:15.877
Boss!

548
45:17.944 --> 45:18.744
What?

549
45:19.344 --> 45:20.544
You didn't even wait for me.

550
45:20.811 --> 45:22.011
We're going to the fruit shop.

551
45:22.377 --> 45:25.177
I want to buy some grapes for Mr. Warayut.

552
45:26.277 --> 45:27.077
Huh?

553
45:29.211 --> 45:30.377
Mr. Warayut?

554
45:31.344 --> 45:32.957
The vineyard owner?

555
45:32.957 --> 45:33.677
Mm-hmm.

556
45:34.877 --> 45:35.677
Wait

557
45:37.277 --> 45:41.211
So you're buying grapes to give to the owner of a vineyard?

558
45:41.977 --> 45:42.777
Ugh!

559
45:43.377 --> 45:45.011
Ruby Roman grapes

560
45:45.411 --> 45:46.544
are rare.

561
45:47.377 --> 45:48.611
They're also incredibly expensive.

562
45:49.277 --> 45:51.077
Anyone who receives them would be impressed.

563
45:51.377 --> 45:52.177
Ow!

564
45:53.311 --> 45:54.111
Boss...

565
45:54.977 --> 45:56.411
He grows grapes to eat fresh...

566
45:56.877 --> 45:57.944
And grapes to make wine.

567
45:58.477 --> 46:00.477
He spends every waking hour surrounded by grapes.

568
46:01.877 --> 46:03.711
I think he'd be sick of them by now.

569
46:07.811 --> 46:10.504
Then let's see you show off your assistant skills.

570
46:11.211 --> 46:12.905
What should I buy for Mr. Warayut?

571
46:14.436 --> 46:15.536
Okay, okay.

572
46:18.977 --> 46:21.341
So, our client is Mr. Warayut.

573
46:21.930 --> 46:24.671
He's 45, single...

574
46:24.671 --> 46:28.477
And extremely health-conscious.

575
46:29.011 --> 46:29.811
Hmm.

576
46:35.377 --> 46:38.577
I'd recommend premium-grade matcha.

577
46:40.511 --> 46:41.511
Why matcha?

578
46:42.144 --> 46:44.570
Because matcha...

579
46:44.982 --> 46:46.950
Can be blended with fruit.

580
46:47.244 --> 46:49.258
It's perfect for someone who's really into healthy living.

581
46:49.906 --> 46:51.853
Well? Pretty clever, huh?

582
46:56.811 --> 46:59.971
Giving someone something they'll actually use...

583
46:59.971 --> 47:01.877
It feels way more thoughtful.

584
47:04.911 --> 47:06.611
No wonder you've dealt with so many people.

585
47:07.711 --> 47:09.744
You always know how to get yourself out of any situation.

586
47:11.544 --> 47:15.477
You're a bit like a chameleon, aren't you?

587
47:19.744 --> 47:20.562
I'll take that as a compliment.

588
47:20.798 --> 47:21.813
Mm-hmm.

589
47:22.477 --> 47:23.448
Wait!

590
47:23.448 --> 47:24.301
Were you just complimenting me, Boss?

591
47:24.301 --> 47:25.144
Of course.

592
47:25.511 --> 47:26.377
A chameleon, I said.

593
47:26.877 --> 47:27.677
It's absolutely adorable.

594
47:33.677 --> 47:34.877
Boss, wait.

595
48:10.677 --> 48:11.477
Uh...

596
48:13.211 --> 48:14.177
Let's get going.

597
48:23.511 --> 48:24.477
Chameleon...

598
48:36.544 --> 48:37.344
Boss.

599
48:39.511 --> 48:40.611
This is for you.

600
48:41.777 --> 48:42.577
What is it?

601
48:44.277 --> 48:46.611
Peppermint tea blended with chamomile.

602
48:47.011 --> 48:49.411
It'll help you sleep better.

603
48:50.211 --> 48:51.211
And clear your nose, too.

604
48:55.677 --> 48:58.077
Why buy this for me? You're just wasting your money.

605
48:58.811 --> 49:01.212
Oh, come on. Just take it.

606
49:01.565 --> 49:03.911
Please? I bought it for you.

607
49:07.677 --> 49:08.477
Thank you.

608
49:08.677 --> 49:09.177
Oh!

609
49:09.177 --> 49:10.977
It's okay. I'll take it for you for now.

610
49:12.277 --> 49:16.377
But if you drink it and sleep well...

611
49:17.377 --> 49:20.077
I'll let you dream about me.

612
49:25.711 --> 49:28.277
No thanks. I don't want nightmares.

613
49:40.211 --> 49:41.741
Wait here for a moment.

614
49:42.035 --> 49:44.705
I need to take this call. I'll be right back.

615
49:51.377 --> 49:52.177
Nant.

616
49:54.511 --> 49:55.311
Wow.

617
49:55.711 --> 49:56.677
I almost didn't recognize you.

618
49:57.344 --> 49:58.344
You've really cleaned up your act.

619
49:59.911 --> 50:01.477
Even wearing a designer suit now.

620
50:04.411 --> 50:05.211
Move.

621
50:06.277 --> 50:07.711
I'm not available to talk right now.

622
50:08.111 --> 50:08.911
I'm working.

623
50:09.611 --> 50:11.144
Still doing those paid-girlfriend gigs?

624
50:12.977 --> 50:14.277
You're still doing that, Nant?

625
50:15.411 --> 50:16.411
It's dangerous.

626
50:19.177 --> 50:20.477
I don't do that anymore.

627
50:21.811 --> 50:22.744
But whatever.

628
50:23.211 --> 50:24.577
I don't want to talk to you.

629
50:27.111 --> 50:29.332
Come on, it's not every day you run into your ex.

630
50:30.451 --> 50:31.377
Don't you want to catch up?

631
50:33.611 --> 50:35.111
I miss you, Nant.

632
50:35.944 --> 50:37.544
You blocked me on everything.

633
50:38.711 --> 50:39.511
It really hurts.

634
50:44.277 --> 50:46.077
We have nothing left to talk about.

635
50:46.777 --> 50:47.744
What's there to be upset about?

636
50:51.077 --> 50:53.510
Hey, that was you the other day, wasn't it?

637
50:53.981 --> 50:55.121
The one who ruined Boss Chat's wedding.

638
50:55.769 --> 50:57.970
How could you pick a fight with someone that powerful?

639
51:00.477 --> 51:01.711
That's none of your business, isn't it?

640
51:02.777 --> 51:03.577
Let go!

641
51:03.944 --> 51:04.944
I don't want to talk to you.

642
51:07.744 --> 51:08.911
Hey! Give it back!

643
51:09.146 --> 51:09.711
Just let me borrow it for a second.

644
51:09.711 --> 51:10.511
Give it back!

645
51:10.544 --> 51:11.377
I'll unblock myself first.

646
51:11.544 --> 51:12.344
Hey, give it back!

647
51:12.744 --> 51:13.955
Just for a second!

648
51:13.955 --> 51:14.691
Ow!

649
51:17.011 --> 51:18.224
Why are you so protective of your phone?

650
51:20.050 --> 51:22.809
Got some secrets in there?

651
51:23.575 --> 51:25.827
Back off! Hand it over!

652
51:26.710 --> 51:27.587
Give it back!

653
51:27.587 --> 51:29.207
Just for a second.

654
51:29.207 --> 51:31.049
What are you doing to my secretary?

655
51:36.177 --> 51:37.300
Who are you?

656
51:39.891 --> 51:41.047
Are you one of Nant's clients?

657
51:41.047 --> 51:43.854
Wait a second. Let me deal with my ex first.

658
51:45.444 --> 51:46.222
What ex?

659
51:46.752 --> 51:48.164
We're already broken up.

660
51:50.577 --> 51:51.744
Give me my phone back.

661
51:52.111 --> 51:53.511
Give her phone back.

662
51:58.077 --> 52:00.011
I said give her phone back!

663
52:02.144 --> 52:03.011
Boss Chat.

664
52:09.944 --> 52:10.744
Are you okay?

665
52:11.711 --> 52:12.877
Did she do anything to you?

666
52:14.311 --> 52:15.311
I'm fine.

667
52:17.711 --> 52:19.182
Boss...

668
52:19.182 --> 52:20.650
It's just a misunderstanding.

669
52:22.063 --> 52:25.014
I'm Mind. I'm in the design department.

670
52:25.014 --> 52:26.711
It’s a pleasure to meet you.

671
52:28.677 --> 52:32.111
Wow, your attitude changed fast when you saw the boss.

672
52:33.877 --> 52:35.777
I was just saying hello to you. That's all.

673
52:37.777 --> 52:41.577
If you're done here, let's go, Nant.

674
52:49.177 --> 52:51.011
She's Boss Chat's secretary?

675
53:07.944 --> 53:10.477
Are you okay? Does anything hurt?

676
53:13.744 --> 53:14.677
I'm fine.

677
53:23.877 --> 53:27.544
And your tea bag survived, Boss.

678
53:30.877 --> 53:32.754
You really don't look out for yourself, do you?

679
53:33.166 --> 53:35.789
Next time, just smack her with that tea bag.

680
53:38.611 --> 53:39.723
That lady from earlier...

681
53:40.312 --> 53:41.387
She's my ex.

682
53:44.390 --> 53:47.639
Things didn't exactly end well between us.

683
53:50.277 --> 53:51.711
She's an employee here, right?

684
53:52.911 --> 53:54.311
Is there anything I can do to help?

685
53:55.277 --> 53:56.677
Oh, no, it's okay.

686
53:57.477 --> 53:58.711
I can handle it myself.

687
54:02.777 --> 54:05.511
I just didn't expect to run into her today.

688
54:08.311 --> 54:10.144
But you don't need to worry about it, Boss.

689
54:10.977 --> 54:13.011
Mind's always been like that.

690
54:14.111 --> 54:15.011
Like what?

691
54:17.577 --> 54:19.067
Well...

692
54:20.127 --> 54:21.750
She can't resist someone with money.

693
54:22.928 --> 54:27.211
The moment she saw you, her whole attitude changed.

694
54:29.411 --> 54:31.684
Hmm, I noticed.

695
54:34.216 --> 54:37.779
I think you're the one who shouldn't dwell on it.

696
54:48.711 --> 54:49.877
I'll be right back.

697
55:12.811 --> 55:13.963
Hello, Ai.

698
55:15.317 --> 55:19.402
If you run into someone who's super stressed or unusually down,

699
55:20.462 --> 55:22.217
What can you do to make them feel better?

700
55:22.667 --> 55:24.667
Hmm? Who are you talking about?

701
55:26.777 --> 55:28.087
I'm asking you a question.

702
55:28.087 --> 55:30.977
Just answer me instead of asking me questions.

703
55:32.931 --> 55:35.355
How am I supposed to know who you mean?

704
55:35.355 --> 55:38.083
When I'm sad, I go to a host bar.

705
55:38.083 --> 55:40.386
And when you're sad, you probably take on more work, right?

706
55:40.386 --> 55:42.386
Everyone finds happiness in different ways.

707
55:46.311 --> 55:49.611
It's a junior...

708
55:49.611 --> 55:50.952
Just someone younger than me.

709
55:52.218 --> 55:56.112
Anyway, what do normal people do when they're sad?

710
55:57.196 --> 55:59.196
If they don't see a doctor or take medication...

711
55:59.196 --> 56:01.196
They probably eat something delicious and sweet.

712
56:08.677 --> 56:10.811
Got it. That's all.

713
56:36.311 --> 56:37.411
This feels so unfamiliar.

714
56:37.977 --> 56:39.277
You're usually so feisty.

715
56:39.777 --> 56:41.411
But after running into your ex...

716
56:42.011 --> 56:42.944
Suddenly, you became so quiet, huh?

717
56:48.177 --> 56:50.511
I just didn't expect to run into her today.

718
56:51.877 --> 56:53.911
Ever since I caught her cheating...

719
56:54.811 --> 56:57.344
I've tried to cut off all contact with her.

720
57:00.377 --> 57:01.744
Then why are you still sad?

721
57:02.544 --> 57:03.511
Haven't you moved on?

722
57:06.944 --> 57:08.577
I've moved on from her.

723
57:11.011 --> 57:12.777
But I haven't forgotten how much it hurt.

724
57:16.544 --> 57:19.677
I don't know how I put up with someone like her.

725
57:27.113 --> 57:28.053
Mind.

726
57:32.977 --> 57:33.777
Nant...

727
58:02.144 --> 58:04.144
Do I seem completely worthless?

728
58:09.577 --> 58:11.511
One person might think you're worthless...

729
58:13.077 --> 58:16.211
but you might be the treasure another has been searching for.

730
58:20.977 --> 58:22.111
I think that lady...

731
58:22.344 --> 58:23.977
Simply underestimated your worth.

732
58:24.877 --> 58:26.377
You're not worthless at all.

733
58:28.211 --> 58:29.011
Here.

734
58:29.477 --> 58:30.277
Eat.

735
58:30.944 --> 58:32.611
It's a trade for the tea you bought me.

736
58:35.077 --> 58:35.877
Here.

737
58:56.944 --> 58:59.544
Hurry up before it melts.

738
59:14.811 --> 59:15.611
Is it good?

739
59:20.577 --> 59:21.377
It's delicious.

740
59:23.277 --> 59:26.744
Ice cream is supposed to lower stress..

741
59:28.311 --> 59:31.077
but if I got to eat you whole, Boss,

742
59:32.277 --> 59:34.377
my stress would completely disappear.

743
59:38.611 --> 59:39.711
You're unbelievable.

744
59:53.177 --> 59:53.977
Boss...

745
01:00:09.011 --> 01:00:10.544
Want to share some with me?

746
01:00:15.144 --> 01:00:16.944
And where do you want me to eat it from?

747
01:00:18.277 --> 01:00:21.711
Your hand or your mouth?

748
01:00:55.944 --> 01:00:56.744
Uh...

749
01:00:57.911 --> 01:01:00.411
Hanna has sent the karaoke location.

750
01:01:01.944 --> 01:01:02.744
Let's go.

751
01:01:03.144 --> 01:01:04.111
I'll drive you there.

752
01:01:05.411 --> 01:01:06.211
Hey,

753
01:01:07.177 --> 01:01:07.977
Boss...

754
01:01:12.611 --> 01:01:16.277
Was it sweet?

755
01:01:20.604 --> 01:01:21.938
Yes, it was.

756
01:01:29.411 --> 01:01:30.243
Hey.

757
01:01:31.597 --> 01:01:32.742
Did you...

758
01:01:34.096 --> 01:01:35.540
You said you'd drive me there.

759
01:01:35.540 --> 01:01:37.344
Aren't you coming inside with me?

760
01:01:39.511 --> 01:01:42.311
No. I don't like singing.

761
01:01:46.577 --> 01:01:49.111
Then you'll miss seeing me with a microphone.

762
01:01:50.711 --> 01:01:54.277
Otherwise, you’d know just how hot I am.

763
01:01:56.944 --> 01:01:59.744
Hot? Looking like this?

764
01:02:01.944 --> 01:02:02.840
Well...

765
01:02:04.371 --> 01:02:07.211
If you don't believe me, you'll have to see for yourself.

766
01:02:11.944 --> 01:02:14.482
Okay, fine.

767
01:02:15.012 --> 01:02:16.850
I'll stop by for a little while.

768
01:02:17.262 --> 01:02:21.002
So I can see how my employees act outside of work...

769
01:02:21.002 --> 01:02:23.246
how wild they actually act.

770
01:02:25.711 --> 01:02:27.200
I'll be watching you too, Boss.

771
01:02:28.083 --> 01:02:30.794
Let's see how long you can put up with our craziness.

772
01:02:33.544 --> 01:02:34.044
Don't worry.

773
01:02:34.986 --> 01:02:37.891
I'm much better at handling crazy peoplet than you think.

774
01:02:39.612 --> 01:02:41.023
Let's go.

775
01:02:48.911 --> 01:02:49.477
Here.

776
01:02:49.477 --> 01:02:50.277
Let me help.

777
01:02:54.411 --> 01:02:55.611
Take this and throw it away for them too.

778
01:03:04.111 --> 01:03:05.477
Hello, Jaokha. What's up?

779
01:03:06.477 --> 01:03:08.277
Yeah, I just finished a C-section.

780
01:03:08.511 --> 01:03:09.911
I'll talk to you later. I'm hungry.

781
01:03:11.777 --> 01:03:15.111
Excuse me, could I have that ham and cheese croissant?

782
01:03:15.211 --> 01:03:16.011
Certainly.

783
01:03:16.511 --> 01:03:19.277
Excuse me, I actually had my eye on this first.

784
01:03:20.811 --> 01:03:23.925
So what if you had your eye on it?

785
01:03:24.749 --> 01:03:27.946
The rule everywhere is first order, first get.

786
01:03:30.811 --> 01:03:34.882
Sweetie, I just delivered triplets. I desperately need carbs...

787
01:03:34.882 --> 01:03:39.144
And fat, right now. I'll buy it off you, okay?

788
01:03:40.611 --> 01:03:41.511
I'm not selling it.

789
01:03:41.744 --> 01:03:42.877
I want to eat it too.

790
01:03:43.544 --> 01:03:45.311
So go find something else to eat, sis.

791
01:03:46.577 --> 01:03:48.611
Excuse me, I'll take that one.

792
01:03:48.777 --> 01:03:49.577
Please heat it up.

793
01:03:49.677 --> 01:03:51.144
I'll pay by QR code.

794
01:03:53.211 --> 01:03:54.811
I'll pay with my black card.

795
01:03:55.077 --> 01:03:56.144
I'll pay double.

796
01:03:56.377 --> 01:03:57.247
No, ten times the price!

797
01:03:57.248 --> 01:03:58.895
I think you made a mistake. I ordered this way back.

798
01:03:58.895 --> 01:04:01.366
I've already paid for it. Sorry.

799
01:04:03.144 --> 01:04:04.277
This is all your fault!

800
01:04:04.577 --> 01:04:05.477
It's your fault.

801
01:04:05.577 --> 01:04:07.477
You just had to show off your money! Ugh!

802
01:04:07.677 --> 01:04:08.711
Now I don't get to eat it.

803
01:04:09.177 --> 01:04:09.977
Oh!

804
01:04:12.311 --> 01:04:13.144
Pretty face,

805
01:04:13.577 --> 01:04:14.711
ugly personality.

806
01:04:15.211 --> 01:04:16.377
Don't let me catch you again.

807
01:04:41.011 --> 01:04:43.377
How did this place pass its safety inspection?

808
01:04:43.911 --> 01:04:45.311
The bass is shaking the whole building.

809
01:04:46.011 --> 01:04:47.811
Shouldn't the whole structure be cracking by now?

810
01:04:49.011 --> 01:04:49.811
Boss...

811
01:04:50.577 --> 01:04:52.177
This is a karaoke bar.

812
01:04:52.777 --> 01:04:53.977
Not a construction site.

813
01:04:56.811 --> 01:04:58.777
I'm just worried it might be dangerous.

814
01:05:03.011 --> 01:05:04.677
You seem scared of something, Boss.

815
01:05:06.411 --> 01:05:13.377
Wait, are you afraid you'll open the door and find Hanna pole dancing?

816
01:05:14.944 --> 01:05:15.807
No.

817
01:05:17.103 --> 01:05:19.213
I just don't like singing, that's all.

818
01:05:23.977 --> 01:05:24.777
How about this?

819
01:05:26.477 --> 01:05:28.377
I'll let you hold my hand, Boss.

820
01:05:30.344 --> 01:05:31.877
Your secretary...

821
01:05:33.744 --> 01:05:35.411
Will protect you, Boss.

822
01:05:36.411 --> 01:05:40.144
I promise no one will shove a mic in your face.

823
01:05:47.011 --> 01:05:49.577
No, I don't want to have nightmares.

824
01:06:19.377 --> 01:06:20.177
Oh, come on!

825
01:06:21.077 --> 01:06:23.344
You guys look like you're being held hostage at a funeral.

826
01:06:23.944 --> 01:06:24.877
Then I'm leaving.

827
01:06:25.111 --> 01:06:26.311
Oh, Boss!

828
01:06:27.211 --> 01:06:28.211
Wait, Boss!

829
01:06:29.111 --> 01:06:33.944
Boss never comes to team dinners like this.

830
01:06:34.377 --> 01:06:35.944
So we're not really used to it.

831
01:06:46.877 --> 01:06:48.311
Then get used to it.

832
01:06:49.144 --> 01:06:50.677
And have fun like you always do.

833
01:06:52.077 --> 01:06:52.877
Here.

834
01:06:53.677 --> 01:06:55.611
Drinks are on me tonight.

835
01:07:04.977 --> 01:07:05.777
Let's drinks.

836
01:07:06.177 --> 01:07:06.977
Let's drinks.

837
01:07:12.344 --> 01:07:16.387
No, we can't all sit here looking so miserable.

838
01:07:17.035 --> 01:07:19.306
Otherwise, this party will be dead until morning.

839
01:07:19.954 --> 01:07:23.757
Since Boss is paying, what are we waiting for? Let's go!

840
01:07:27.575 --> 01:07:29.575
Cheers!

841
01:07:30.344 --> 01:07:31.426
That's refreshing!

842
01:07:32.368 --> 01:07:33.344
Cheers.

843
01:07:54.811 --> 01:07:55.911
Cheers.

844
01:07:56.144 --> 01:07:57.544
Come on, come on!

845
01:07:58.511 --> 01:07:59.877
Let's finish our drinks tonight!

846
01:08:04.117 --> 01:08:06.647
Cheers! Cheers!

847
01:08:10.934 --> 01:08:12.934
Cheers!

848
01:08:13.544 --> 01:08:15.211
Give me a bath, too.

849
01:08:19.277 --> 01:08:22.077
Do you think Hanna's drunk yet?

850
01:08:23.011 --> 01:08:25.177
She's sitting so still. I don't think so.

851
01:08:25.744 --> 01:08:26.501
You don't think that she's drunk?

852
01:08:26.501 --> 01:08:28.544
I don't think she's sober.

853
01:08:28.677 --> 01:08:29.944
Then pour another one so she gets even more wasted.

854
01:08:34.911 --> 01:08:35.811
The next song...

855
01:08:36.944 --> 01:08:40.211
is mine!

856
01:08:59.577 --> 01:09:00.377
Chat!

857
01:09:00.977 --> 01:09:01.944
You're here, too?

858
01:09:07.111 --> 01:09:08.544
Chom!

859
01:09:09.551 --> 01:09:12.258
Come dance with me. Come on. Come on.

860
01:09:16.144 --> 01:09:19.711
Is Hanna always like this when she's drunk?

861
01:09:20.211 --> 01:09:21.011
Oh!

862
01:09:21.577 --> 01:09:22.877
This is just a little bit.

863
01:09:23.311 --> 01:09:24.711
Give her another drink.

864
01:09:25.977 --> 01:09:27.077
She'll definitely be dancing on that table.

865
01:09:30.930 --> 01:09:32.077
Come on!

866
01:09:32.077 --> 01:09:34.277
Get bact to your seat!

867
01:09:35.766 --> 01:09:37.766
Sit down, please!

868
01:09:41.377 --> 01:09:44.877
It's time to start our group's usual game!

869
01:09:45.377 --> 01:09:46.177
Do you remember?

870
01:09:46.277 --> 01:09:46.977
Do you remember?

871
01:09:46.977 --> 01:09:48.303
Do you remember what the game is?

872
01:09:48.303 --> 01:09:49.077
Aha!

873
01:09:49.411 --> 01:09:50.411
How could you forget?

874
01:09:50.877 --> 01:09:52.211
The King's Game!

875
01:09:59.121 --> 01:10:00.455
Wait, wait.

876
01:10:01.744 --> 01:10:03.742
How do you play the King's Game?

877
01:10:05.155 --> 01:10:07.198
It's super easy.

878
01:10:07.492 --> 01:10:10.532
Whoever draws the king's stick

879
01:10:11.062 --> 01:10:13.287
can order any slave to do whatever they want.

880
01:10:13.817 --> 01:10:16.899
But, but, but... if anyone refuses,

881
01:10:19.177 --> 01:10:19.977
here!

882
01:10:20.577 --> 01:10:22.414
They have to down a whole bottle of soju!

883
01:10:22.414 --> 01:10:26.077
Every last drop. Not even a single drop left!

884
01:10:26.277 --> 01:10:27.377
Think you can handle that?

885
01:10:29.311 --> 01:10:30.111
But tonight...

886
01:10:32.577 --> 01:10:33.947
there's no Boss,

887
01:10:34.359 --> 01:10:35.226
no subordinates.

888
01:10:36.168 --> 01:10:38.248
Just the king and the slaves!

889
01:10:52.611 --> 01:10:53.411
Bring it on.

890
01:10:55.411 --> 01:10:56.677
Give each other whatever orders you want.

891
01:10:57.677 --> 01:11:00.377
Just don't complain if your salary gets docked tomorrow.

892
01:11:02.677 --> 01:11:04.811
Who'd dare dock our salaries?

893
01:11:12.611 --> 01:11:13.511
I'm kidding.

894
01:11:13.611 --> 01:11:14.144
Just kidding.

895
01:11:14.144 --> 01:11:14.611
Kidding!

896
01:11:14.611 --> 01:11:15.011
I'm kidding!

897
01:11:15.011 --> 01:11:15.811
Just kidding, just kidding!

898
01:11:18.077 --> 01:11:19.111
Pick a stick already!

899
01:11:19.511 --> 01:11:20.311
What are you waiting for?

900
01:11:20.777 --> 01:11:21.744
I'll go first.

901
01:11:22.977 --> 01:11:26.809
Show me a dance move... like dancing, shaking, over and over!

902
01:11:30.166 --> 01:11:31.718
Why are you going so hard?

903
01:11:32.719 --> 01:11:33.564
So, what did you get?

904
01:11:33.564 --> 01:11:34.852
Not yet! We'll reveal it later.

905
01:11:34.852 --> 01:11:36.086
Wait, wait!

906
01:11:45.411 --> 01:11:47.811
I wanna pick! Let me pick!

907
01:11:50.744 --> 01:11:51.877
I'm the king!

908
01:11:54.077 --> 01:11:55.144
Who has number four?

909
01:11:55.477 --> 01:11:56.611
One shot, please!

910
01:11:57.177 --> 01:11:57.977
Who's number four?

911
01:11:58.677 --> 01:11:59.511
Just one shot first.

912
01:12:00.944 --> 01:12:01.677
Number four!

913
01:12:01.677 --> 01:12:02.344
Number four!

914
01:12:02.344 --> 01:12:03.277
Who's number four?

915
01:12:03.411 --> 01:12:04.211
Who has number four?

916
01:12:07.144 --> 01:12:07.944
It's me.

917
01:12:15.398 --> 01:12:17.398
I'll drink.

918
01:12:20.048 --> 01:12:21.538
Boss might not pay our salaries, you know!

919
01:12:21.538 --> 01:12:25.599
Bottoms up!

920
01:12:32.522 --> 01:12:34.522
No problem.

921
01:12:39.144 --> 01:12:40.344
I'm the king!

922
01:12:43.477 --> 01:12:44.344
Let's go with number two.

923
01:12:45.544 --> 01:12:48.344
Three shots of soju in a row!

924
01:12:50.944 --> 01:12:51.811
Who is it? Who is it?

925
01:12:51.977 --> 01:12:52.611
Who's number two?

926
01:12:52.611 --> 01:12:53.177
Who's number two?

927
01:12:53.177 --> 01:12:53.977
Who's number two?

928
01:12:55.477 --> 01:12:57.144
Who is it?!

929
01:13:02.771 --> 01:13:06.067
Tonight, there’s no Boss. Just the king and the slaves!

930
01:13:12.746 --> 01:13:14.746
Number five!

931
01:13:16.344 --> 01:13:17.144
Is that right?

932
01:13:17.211 --> 01:13:18.011
No.

933
01:13:18.077 --> 01:13:18.577
No.

934
01:13:18.577 --> 01:13:19.911
It's you again, Chat!

935
01:13:20.477 --> 01:13:21.277
Go for it!

936
01:13:22.144 --> 01:13:26.611
Boss, you can do it! Boss, you can do it!

937
01:13:30.377 --> 01:13:31.177
Boss...

938
01:13:31.477 --> 01:13:32.277
Huh?

939
01:13:32.711 --> 01:13:33.777
Are you okay, Boss?

940
01:13:36.677 --> 01:13:38.795
I'm fine. No problem.

